ttps://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":344,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:11:11Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-08-26T09:32:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:20:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7 and 4.8dev3\n- Reproducible with Proton 6 and higher\n- Not reproducible in 4.3 - 4.6\n- Not Reproducible on Proton lower than 5.13\n- Not reproducible on Nvidia GPU and Intel iGPU\n\n### System information\n\nSteam Deck\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a game that crashes on startup when trying to launch the Proton version. Luckily, the same issue can be reproduced with an empty project that uses Forward+ and D3D12. Switching to Vulkan and Forward+ or to Mobile/GL Compatibility fixes the issue for both the game and the empty project. \n\nI attached the Proton logs for it. This line seems important: 5141.347:01fc:0214:err:vulkan:vkCreateComputePipelines Exception 0xc0000005 in Unix call.\n\nThe same behavior is not reproducible on Nvidia so it seems to be an AMD specific bug. Sadly, I don't have another device with an AMD GPU and Linux to verify.\n\nThis could lead to issues if people don't realize that a game ships with a native Linux build and are used to always going over Proton for their games. Or if something else forces the game to only be shippable on Windows.\n\n[steam-404790.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31456634/steam-404790.log)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download the Godot Editor from Steam\n2. Force the usage of Proton as the compatibility tool\n3. Start the editor and create a new project with the Forward Plus renderer\n4. When opening the project, the editor crashes\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty project with \"Forward+\" is enough to reproduce the issue.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122830/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122830/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}